# News parity (NewsController, FinnhubWebhookController, market news archive).
# The shared Vapor has no FINNHUB_API_KEY, FEEDS_BASE_URL or
# FINNHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET, so sync answers 501, the ticker is disabled and the
# webhook 503. Reset fixtures first, every run:
#   docker exec -i norviq-v2-schema-pg psql -U pg -d norviq < parity/news-setup.sql
#   go run ./cmd/parity -a http://127.0.0.1:8081 -b http://127.0.0.1:18115 -jwt-secret parity-secret \
#     -cases parity/news.jsonl -ignore requestId,generatedAt
# Expected diffs: only id/createdAt/updatedAt on "create ok", "create ok
# snake" and "update ok" (fresh uuid and clock).
